    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45747" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφημοσύνη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφίημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>command, behest</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ὧς Μενελάου ἐφημοσύνης ἀμέλησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.697
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.226
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				6.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1144
			</span></i> (lyr.): pl., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.33
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφησθα</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφης, ϝ. φημί</span>
			.</div>
